      },
      "gains": {"max_hp": 8, "attrs": {"str": 1, "agi": 1, "wil": 1}, "resources": {"mana": 3}},
      "unlocks": [],
      "note": "判到**勝利**結局（或劇本寫下 `facts.star_of_the_king`）⇒ ★5。佔位，等你定。"
